-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 3, §3.21 מורה חונך
-- The mentor of a teaching intern: the role, who may fill it, who appoints
-- and when, the mentor's tasks, the mentoring allowance, and the course
-- that trains mentors.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common

§ `3.21 מורה חונך`

DECLARE `setting of the internship` IS ONE OF
    `a kindergarten`
    `a school`
    `the social-community field`

DECLARE `appointing authority` IS ONE OF
    `the kindergarten supervisor`
    `the principal of the intern's school`
    `the district head of the society and youth administration, or a representative`
    `the subject supervisor, from outside the school's staff`

@desc A candidate mentor, as section 3.21.2 asks about them.
DECLARE `mentor candidate` HAS
    `holds a teaching certificate or licence`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `years of teaching seniority`                     IS A NUMBER
    `years in the intern's age layer`                 IS A NUMBER
    `post-primary`                                    IS A BOOLEAN @desc the internship is in post-primary education
    `has taught one of the intern's subjects`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `training meetings attended in the mentoring year` IS A NUMBER @desc meetings, of those the intern's training institution offers during the mentoring year, the candidate took active part in
    `academic degree`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `seniority in training student teachers`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `trained in, or taking, a mentors' course`        IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `mentoring action` IS ONE OF
    `appoint the mentor in writing`
    `attach the appointment letter to the summative evaluation`
    `document in writing the feedback on the intern's work, lesson-observation reports included`
    `take an active part in the formative evaluation`
    `take an active part in the summative evaluation`
    `pay the mentoring allowance` HAS `amount of allowance` IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `mentor's support` IS ONE OF `professional support`, `social support`, `emotional support`
DECLARE `mentor's help` IS ONE OF
    `taking root in the specific workplace`
    `growing the abilities the intern needs in the role, continuing the intern's training for teaching`
DECLARE `stage of evaluation` IS ONE OF `the formative evaluation`, `the summative evaluation`

DECLARE `mentor's task` IS ONE OF
    `a personal professional bond with the intern`
    `observing the intern's lessons`
    `ongoing contact with the internship coordinator of the training institution`
    `the formative evaluation in mid-year`
    `membership of the summative-evaluation committee at the end of the year`

DECLARE `course topic` IS ONE OF
    `developing the conception of the mentoring role`
    `developing guidance and facilitation skills`
    `developing skills of absorption and accompaniment in a team`
    `developing and imparting evaluation and feedback tools`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21/p2
`the day section 3.21 applies from` MEANS Date 2 12 2001

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_21/p3 A heading ("1. הגדרת התפקיד", the definition of the role).

§§ `1. הגדרת התפקיד`

-- 1.1: the mentor accompanies the intern through the whole of the first
-- year of teaching, in every aspect, giving professional, social and
-- emotional support.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21/p4
`the support the mentor gives` MEANS
    LIST `professional support`, `social support`, `emotional support`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21/p4
GIVEN `year of teaching` IS A NUMBER @desc which year of the intern's teaching this is (the first is 1)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the mentor accompanies the intern in` `year of teaching` IF
    `year of teaching` EQUALS 1

-- 1.2: the mentor helps the intern take root in the specific workplace;
-- the way is growing the abilities the intern needs in the role, continuing
-- the intern's training for teaching.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21/p5
`what the mentor helps the intern toward` MEANS `taking root in the specific workplace`

`the way the mentor helps` MEANS
    `growing the abilities the intern needs in the role, continuing the intern's training for teaching`

-- 1.3 (its first line is a heading the corpus keeps apart): an active
-- partner in both stages of the evaluation — "formative" and "summative" —
-- documenting the feedback on the intern's work in writing, lesson-observation
-- reports included, as the basis of the evaluation committee's decisions.
-- (How the mentor takes part in each stage is 4(d)-(e)'s, encoded there.)
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_1_3 akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_1_3/p1
`the stages of the intern's evaluation` MEANS
    LIST `the formative evaluation`, `the summative evaluation`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_1_3/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `mentoring action`
DECIDE `the mentor's part in the evaluation` IS
    (PARTY `the teaching employee` MUST `take an active part in the formative evaluation`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teaching employee` MUST `take an active part in the summative evaluation`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teaching employee` MUST `document in writing the feedback on the intern's work, lesson-observation reports included`)

§§ `2. התנאים הנדרשים למילוי התפקיד`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_1_3/p2 A heading ("2. התנאים הנדרשים למילוי התפקיד", the conditions of the role).

-- F-3.21-a: condition (d) is met only during the mentoring year, after the
-- appointment (which 3.5 requires within a month of the intern's
-- placement). The reading adopted: (a)-(c) qualify for appointment, and (d)
-- is a condition of continuing to hold the role, judged at the year's end.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_1_3/p3 akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_1_3/p4 akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_1_3/p5
GIVEN c IS A `mentor candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be appointed mentor` c IF
        c's `holds a teaching certificate or licence`
    AND c's `years of teaching seniority` AT LEAST 4
    AND c's `years in the intern's age layer` AT LEAST 2
    AND (c's `post-primary` IMPLIES c's `has taught one of the intern's subjects`)

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_1_3/p6
GIVEN c IS A `mentor candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `met every condition of the role by the year's end` c IF
    `may be appointed mentor` c AND c's `training meetings attended in the mentoring year` AT LEAST 2

-- Preference is given to a candidate who has any one of the three; the
-- text does not rank them or add them up.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_1_3/p7
GIVEN c IS A `mentor candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is given preference` c IF
       c's `academic degree`
    OR c's `seniority in training student teachers`
    OR c's `trained in, or taking, a mentors' course`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_1_3/p8 A heading ("3. המינוי לתפקיד", the appointment).

§§ `3. המינוי לתפקיד`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_1 akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_2 akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_3 akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_4
GIVEN s IS A `setting of the internship`, `the intern is the only teacher of the subject in the school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `appointing authority`
DECIDE `who appoints the mentor` s `the intern is the only teacher of the subject in the school` IS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `a kindergarten` THEN `the kindergarten supervisor`
    WHEN `a school` THEN
        IF `the intern is the only teacher of the subject in the school`
        THEN `the subject supervisor, from outside the school's staff`
        ELSE `the principal of the intern's school`
    WHEN `the social-community field` THEN `the district head of the society and youth administration, or a representative`

-- 3.5-3.6 (3.6's first line is a heading the corpus keeps apart): as
-- early as possible, near the intern's hiring, and in any case within a
-- month (30 days) of the intern's placement; in writing, a copy of the
-- letter being attached to the summative evaluation. Time in days
-- from the placement. The duty is the appointing authority's, whichever
-- 3.1-3.4 names for the setting; the text says not who attaches the copy
-- ("יצורף"), and the encoding gives it to the same authority.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_5 akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_6 akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_6/p1
GIVEN s IS A `setting of the internship`, `the intern is the only teacher of the subject in the school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `appointing authority` `mentoring action`
DECIDE `appointing the mentor within a month` s `the intern is the only teacher of the subject in the school` IS
    PARTY `who appoints the mentor` s `the intern is the only teacher of the subject in the school`
    MUST  `appoint the mentor in writing`
    WITHIN 30
    HENCE (PARTY `who appoints the mentor` s `the intern is the only teacher of the subject in the school`
           MUST `attach the appointment letter to the summative evaluation`)
    LEST  BREACH BY `who appoints the mentor` s `the intern is the only teacher of the subject in the school`
          BECAUSE "section 3.21.3.5: the mentor is appointed no later than a month after the intern's placement"

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_6/p2 A heading ("4. תפקידי החונך", the mentor's tasks).

§§ `4. תפקידי החונך`

`the mentor's tasks` MEANS
    LIST
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_6/p3
        -- (a) a personal professional bond with the intern.
        `a personal professional bond with the intern`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_6/p4
        -- (b) observing the intern's lessons.
        `observing the intern's lessons`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_6/p5
        -- (c) ongoing contact with the training institution's internship coordinator.
        `ongoing contact with the internship coordinator of the training institution`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_6/p6
        -- (d) the formative evaluation, in mid-year.
        `the formative evaluation in mid-year`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_6/p7
        -- (e) membership of the summative-evaluation committee, at the year's end.
        `membership of the summative-evaluation committee at the end of the year`

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_3_6/p8 A heading ("5. גמול חונך", the mentoring allowance).

§§ `5. גמול חונך`

-- 5.1: the mentor is entitled to a mentoring allowance, updated every
-- year (so the year's amount is an input); the figure the text gives is
-- the one for תשס"ב.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_5_1
GIVEN `is the intern's appointed mentor` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the mentoring allowance` `is the intern's appointed mentor` IF
    `is the intern's appointed mentor`

GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the monthly mentoring allowance in תשס"ב, gross` IS 291.61

-- 5.2: 12 monthly payments for a whole school year of mentoring; for part
-- of a year, the matching part, the summer break's share included. The
-- reading: the school year is its ten teaching months (September-June) and
-- the summer's two follow them pro rata. The result is the number of
-- monthly allowances owed.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_5_2
GIVEN `months of the school year mentored` IS A NUMBER @desc months of the 10-month school year (September-June) the mentor mentored the intern
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `monthly allowances owed` `months of the school year mentored` IS
    IF `months of the school year mentored` AT LEAST 10
    THEN 12
    ELSE 12 TIMES `months of the school year mentored` DIVIDED BY 10

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_5_2
GIVEN `this year's monthly allowance` IS A NUMBER @desc the monthly mentoring allowance as updated for the year; an input
      , `months of the school year mentored` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `mentoring allowance for the year` `this year's monthly allowance` `months of the school year mentored` IS
    `this year's monthly allowance` TIMES `monthly allowances owed` `months of the school year mentored`

§§ `6. קורסים להכשרת חונכים`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_1
`the mentors' course covers at least` MEANS
    LIST
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_1__para_a
        -- (a) developing the conception of the mentoring role.
        `developing the conception of the mentoring role`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_1__para_b
        -- (b) guidance and facilitation skills.
        `developing guidance and facilitation skills`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_1__para_c
        -- (c) skills of absorption and accompaniment in a team.
        `developing skills of absorption and accompaniment in a team`,
        @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_1__para_d
        -- (d) evaluation and feedback tools.
        `developing and imparting evaluation and feedback tools`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_2
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours of the mentors' course` IS 112 PLUS 56

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_3
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the mentors' course counts toward the in-service training allowance` IS TRUE

-- 6.4: the colleges that gave the course in תשס"ב, by district — a
-- directory for registration, dated, carrying no rule.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_4 The opening of the תשס"ב directory: where to register for the courses.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_4__para_a Directory (תשס"ב): colleges training kindergarten mentors, by district.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_4__para_b Directory (תשס"ב): colleges training teacher mentors, by district.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_4__para_c Directory (תשס"ב): the course training English-teacher mentors.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_4/p2 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_21__ssec_6_4/p3 Source (אסמכתא): a Director-General's circular.

-- Examples.
`a candidate with 6 years, 3 in the layer, at 1 meeting` MEANS
    `mentor candidate` WITH
        `holds a teaching certificate or licence`          IS TRUE
        `years of teaching seniority`                     IS 6
        `years in the intern's age layer`                 IS 3
        `post-primary`                                    IS FALSE
        `has taught one of the intern's subjects`         IS FALSE
        `training meetings attended in the mentoring year` IS 1
        `academic degree`                                 IS TRUE
        `seniority in training student teachers`          IS FALSE
        `trained in, or taking, a mentors' course`        IS TRUE

#ASSERT `may be appointed mentor` `a candidate with 6 years, 3 in the layer, at 1 meeting`
#ASSERT `is given preference` `a candidate with 6 years, 3 in the layer, at 1 meeting`
#ASSERT `mentoring allowance for the year` 100 5 EQUALS 600
#ASSERT `who appoints the mentor` `a school` TRUE EQUALS `the subject supervisor, from outside the school's staff`
-- The course's hours add up as the text states them: 112 + 56 = 168.
#ASSERT `hours of the mentors' course` EQUALS 168

#TRACE `appointing the mentor within a month` `a school` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the principal of the intern's school` DOES `appoint the mentor in writing` AT 20
    PARTY `the principal of the intern's school` DOES `attach the appointment letter to the summative evaluation` AT 250

-- F-3.21-a: at the appointment (within a month of placement) condition (d)
-- cannot yet be met; a candidate who meets (a)-(c) is not, then, one who
-- meets "the conditions required to fill the role".
`condition (d) cannot be met when the mentor must be appointed` MEANS
        `may be appointed mentor` `a candidate with 6 years, 3 in the layer, at 1 meeting`
    AND NOT `met every condition of the role by the year's end` `a candidate with 6 years, 3 in the layer, at 1 meeting`
#ASSERT `condition (d) cannot be met when the mentor must be appointed`
